# Working directory and environment are task-scoped context keys:
# `#Context(dir:, env:)` sets them for the block (and spawned tasks),
# relative file/DB/process operations resolve against them, imperative
# `chdir`/`set`/`unset` mutate only the current task's context frame, and
# parallel tests and tasks never interfere across O0, O1, and O2.
fixture: ContextDirEnvScopingAndParallelIsolation.fixture
env: NO_COLOR=1
env: JET_STORE_DIR={work}/cache
env: JETPACK_ROOT={work}/jetpack
step: jet run -O0 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = "ok\n"
step: jet run -O1 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = "ok\n"
step: jet run -O2 main.jet
exit: 0
stdout: = "ok\n"
step: jet test -O0 main.jet
exit: 0
step: jet test -O1 main.jet
exit: 0
step: jet test -O2 main.jet
exit: 0
